      "writtenOn": "2019-07-12T21:13:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Will this be okay with CCD mode?  For our old stack, we ended up needing to use CONFIG_USB_PD_PULLUP for initial connections to avoid port partners presenting Ra from triggering CCD (CL:1487116)",
