      "writtenOn": "2019-07-15T16:30:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If CONFIG_USB_PD_MAX_SINGLE_SOURCE_CURRENT isn\u0027t defined, then CONFIG_USB_PD_PULLUP will be used, line 300. Or are you stating that CONFIG_USB_PD_MAX_SINGLE_SOURCE_CURRENT is unnecessary and will affect CCD mode?",
      "parentUuid": "728a30e9_a793130e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 297,
        "startChar": 0,
